msgid "# Mooncake Layerwise KV Cache Pooling"
msgstr "# Mooncake 分层 KV 缓存池化"

msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 特性介绍"

msgid ""
"Mooncake layerwise KV cache pooling transfers KV caches between Ascend NPUs and\n"
"a shared Mooncake Store one layer at a time. It uses `AscendStoreConnector` with\n"
"`backend=\"mooncake\"` and `use_layerwise=true` to reuse cached prefixes across\n"
"requests and vLLM instances."
msgstr ""
"Mooncake 分层 KV 缓存池化以逐层方式在昇腾 NPU 与共享的 Mooncake Store 之间传输 KV 缓存。它使用 "
"`AscendStoreConnector`，并设置 `backend=\"mooncake\"` 和 "
"`use_layerwise=true`，以在多个请求和 vLLM 实例之间复用已缓存的 prefix。"

msgid ""
"Layerwise transfer allows KV loading and saving to overlap attention computation.\n"
"It also stores the layers of a cache block in one remote object, reducing\n"
"metadata overhead compared with creating a separate object for every layer."
msgstr ""
"分层传输允许 KV 的加载和保存与注意力计算重叠进行。它还将一个缓存块的所有层存储在一个远程对象中，相比为每一层创建单独的对象，减少了元数据开销。"

msgid ""
"For Mooncake service deployment and general pool configuration, see\n"
"[KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store)](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md). For models with\n"
"multiple cache groups, see [Mooncake Layerwise Hybrid Attention](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)."
msgstr ""
"关于 Mooncake 服务部署和通用池配置，请参见\n"
"[KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。对于具有多个缓存组的模型，请参见 [Mooncake 分层混合注意力](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)。"

msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
msgstr "### 使用场景"

msgid ""
"- Repeated requests with long shared prefixes, such as system prompts or document contexts.\n"
"- Multiple serving instances that share prefixes through the same Mooncake Store.\n"
"- Prefill workloads where KV transfer can overlap per-layer attention computation."
msgstr ""
"- 具有较长共享 prefix 的重复请求，例如系统提示词或文档上下文。\n"
"- 通过同一个 Mooncake Store 共享 prefix 的多个服务实例。\n"
"- KV 传输可与逐层注意力计算重叠进行的 Prefill 工作负载。"

msgid "### Constraints and Limitations"
msgstr "### 约束与限制"

msgid "| Category | Constraint |"
msgstr "| 类别 | 约束 |"

msgid ""
"| Software | Requires a Mooncake NPU client with session and range transfer "
"APIs; use Mooncake 0.3.14 or later. Required interfaces are checked at "
"startup. |"
msgstr ""
"| 软件 | 需要带有会话和范围传输 API 的 Mooncake NPU 客户端；请使用 Mooncake 0.3.14 "
"或更高版本。所需接口会在启动时进行检查。 |"

msgid ""
"| Deployment | Use the corresponding producer/consumer role on each P/D "
"node. Decode pool reads and writes are controlled separately by "
"`consumer_is_to_load` and `consumer_is_to_put`. |"
msgstr ""
"| 部署 | 在每个 P/D 节点上使用相应的 producer/consumer 角色。Decode 池的读取和写入分别由 "
"`consumer_is_to_load` 和 `consumer_is_to_put` 控制。 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallelism | Instances sharing layerwise objects must use matching TP, "
"PP, and PCP sizes and the same PP layer partition. DCP greater than `1` and "
"TP mismatch are not supported. |"
msgstr ""
"| 并行 | 共享分层对象的实例必须使用匹配的 TP、PP 和 PCP 大小，以及相同的 PP 层划分。不支持 DCP 大于 `1` 以及 TP "
"不匹配的情况。 |"

msgid ""
"| PP | Uneven layer partitions are supported, but each stage must own layers"
" in every cache group. Empty stage-local cache groups are not supported. |"
msgstr "| PP | 支持不均匀的层划分，但每个 stage 必须在每个缓存组中都拥有层。不支持 stage 本地缓存组为空的情况。 |"

msgid ""
"| Cache layout | Readers and writers must agree on model weights, cache "
"format, block sizes, and transfer mode. Use separate pool namespaces for "
"incompatible configurations. |"
msgstr "| 缓存布局 | 读取方和写入方必须在模型权重、缓存格式、块大小和传输模式上保持一致。对于不兼容的配置，请使用独立的池命名空间。 |"

msgid ""
"| Buffer reuse | Mooncake layerwise transfer does not enable cross-layer "
"reuse of NPU cache buffers. |"
msgstr "| 缓冲区复用 | Mooncake 分层传输不会启用 NPU 缓存缓冲区的跨层复用。 |"

msgid ""
"| KVPP | Experimental for non-hybrid MLA/SFA models with `load_async=false`;"
" cannot be combined with Mooncake layerwise PCP. See [KVPP](kvpp.md) for its"
" support scope. |"
msgstr ""
"| KVPP | 对于使用 `load_async=false` 的非混合 MLA/SFA 模型为实验性功能；不能与 Mooncake 分层 PCP "
"组合使用。其支持范围请参见 [KVPP](kvpp.md)。 |"

msgid ""
"Hybrid models have additional cache-state and execution-mode requirements in the\n"
"[hybrid attention guide](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md#constraints-and-limitations)."
msgstr ""
"混合模型在[混合注意力指南](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md#constraints-and-"
"limitations)中还有额外的缓存状态和执行模式要求。"

msgid "## How It Works"
msgstr "## 工作原理"

msgid "### Block Storage and Layerwise Transfer"
msgstr "### 块存储与分层传输"

msgid ""
"For each cache block and storing rank, Mooncake keeps one object containing the\n"
"cache entries of all layers owned by that rank and pipeline stage:"
msgstr ""
"对于每个缓存块和存储 rank，Mooncake 会保留一个对象，其中包含该 rank 和 pipeline stage 所拥有的所有层的缓存条目："

msgid ""
"Saving a layer writes only its byte ranges into this object. Loading a layer\n"
"reads those ranges into the local NPU cache before the layer consumes them.\n"
"Offsets follow the actual cache layout, including multiple entries in one\n"
"physical layer and entries with different sizes."
msgstr ""
"保存某一层时，仅将其字节范围写入该对象。加载某一层时，会在该层使用这些范围之前将其读入本地 NPU "
"缓存。偏移量遵循实际的缓存布局，包括一个物理层中的多个条目以及大小不同的条目。"

msgid ""
"For a single cache group and pipeline stage, `B` blocks, `L` layers, and `R`\n"
"storing ranks require approximately `B × R` objects, compared with `B × L × R`\n"
"objects in a per-layer object layout. This reduces metadata and lookup work;\n"
"the total KV payload remains the same."
msgstr ""
"对于单个缓存组和 pipeline stage，`B` 个块、`L` 层和 `R` 个存储 rank 大约需要 `B × R` "
"个对象，而逐层对象布局需要 `B × L × R` 个对象。这减少了元数据和查找工作；KV 总负载保持不变。"

msgid "### Computation and Transfer Overlap"
msgstr "### 计算与传输重叠"

msgid ""
"The connector prefetches future layers while the current layer computes\n"
"attention. `layerwise_prefetch_layers` controls how far ahead loads are submitted.\n"
"The current layer waits for its own load to finish before using restored KV.\n"
"Saves start after the corresponding cache updates are ready."
msgstr ""
"连接器会在当前层计算注意力时预取后续层。`layerwise_prefetch_layers` 控制加载提前提交的距离。当前层在使用恢复的 KV "
"之前会等待自身的加载完成。保存操作在相应的缓存更新就绪后开始。"

msgid ""
"Transfers run asynchronously, with device events protecting cache access and\n"
"queue backpressure limiting outstanding work. Transfer may continue into later\n"
"computation or communication. The amount of overlap depends on attention time,\n"
"cache size, and available bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"传输以异步方式运行，通过设备事件保护缓存访问，并通过队列背压限制未完成的工作。传输可能会延续到后续的计算或通信中。重叠的程度取决于注意力时间、缓存大小和可用带宽。"

msgid "### Complete Snapshots and Prefix Reuse"
msgstr "### 完整快照与 Prefix 复用"

msgid ""
"A remote object becomes reusable only after all of its layer ranges have been\n"
"written and committed. A prefix hit requires readable objects from every\n"
"required storing rank and pipeline stage. Partially written objects are not\n"
"reported as reusable cache."
msgstr ""
"远程对象只有在所有层范围都已写入并提交后才可复用。Prefix 命中需要来自每个所需存储 rank 和 pipeline stage "
"的可读对象。部分写入的对象不会被报告为可复用缓存。"

msgid ""
"During chunked prefill, later chunks can restore the committed prefix layer by\n"
"layer. Read sessions keep shared objects available while they are in use and\n"
"are released when the reads finish. Failed writes are revoked so that later\n"
"requests cannot consume an incomplete snapshot."
msgstr ""
"在分块 prefill 期间，后续块可以逐层恢复已提交的 "
"prefix。读取会话在使用期间保持共享对象可用，并在读取完成后释放。失败的写入会被撤销，以便后续请求无法使用不完整的快照。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "### Prepare Mooncake"
msgstr "### 准备 Mooncake"

msgid ""
"Install the Mooncake NPU client, start `mooncake_master`, and configure the\n"
"Ascend network and `mooncake.json` following the **Mooncake Backend** section of\n"
"[KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store)](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md). Select a client\n"
"version that meets the layerwise requirement above rather than the older\n"
"non-layerwise installation example."
msgstr ""
"安装 Mooncake NPU 客户端，启动 `mooncake_master`，并按照\n"
"[KV 缓存池（Ascend Store）](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中 **Mooncake Backend** 一节的说明配置昇腾网络和 `mooncake.json`。请选择满足上述分层要求的客户端版本，而不是较旧的非分层安装示例。"

msgid ""
"Set the configuration path and use the same hash seed on all sharing "
"instances:"
msgstr "设置配置路径，并在所有共享实例上使用相同的哈希种子："

msgid ""
"Sharing instances must connect to the same Store and tenant, with compatible\n"
"model and cache configurations. For independently launched services on the same\n"
"host, assign distinct `lookup_rpc_port` identifiers and HTTP ports."
msgstr ""
"共享实例必须连接到相同的 Store 和租户，并使用兼容的模型和缓存配置。对于同一主机上独立启动的服务，请分配不同的 `lookup_rpc_port`"
" 标识符和 HTTP 端口。"

msgid "### Configure Prefill and Decode Nodes"
msgstr "### 配置 Prefill 和 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"Follow the **PD Disaggregation Scenario** in the\n"
"[Mooncake deployment guide](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-backend)\n"
"for node startup, P/D transfer, and proxy configuration. Configure the\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` on each node as follows."
msgstr ""
"关于节点启动、P/D 传输和代理配置，请遵循\n"
"[Mooncake 部署指南](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-backend) 中的 **PD 分离场景**。按如下方式在每个节点上配置 `AscendStoreConnector`。"

msgid "**Prefill (P) node:**"
msgstr "**Prefill (P) 节点：**"

msgid "**Decode (D) node:**"
msgstr "**Decode (D) 节点：**"

msgid ""
"These examples show the Store connector configuration. In the deployment\n"
"guide's `MultiConnector`, update the `AscendStoreConnector` entry and set\n"
"`kv_load_failure_policy` on the top-level `kv-transfer-config`."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了 Store 连接器的配置。在部署指南的 `MultiConnector` 中，更新 `AscendStoreConnector` "
"条目，并在顶层 `kv-transfer-config` 上设置 `kv_load_failure_policy`。"

msgid ""
"The Prefill node saves and reuses prefixes through the pool. Decode pool reads\n"
"and writes are disabled by default; P/D KV transfer is handled by the other\n"
"connector in `MultiConnector`. To enable Decode pool loading, add\n"
"`\"consumer_is_to_load\": true` to its `kv_connector_extra_config`. Setting\n"
"`use_layerwise=true` alone does not enable consumer pool access."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 节点通过资源池保存并复用前缀。Decode 资源池的读写默认处于禁用状态；P/D KV 传输由 `MultiConnector` "
"中的另一个连接器处理。要启用 Decode 资源池加载，请在其 `kv_connector_extra_config` 中添加 "
"`\"consumer_is_to_load\": true`。仅设置 `use_layerwise=true` 并不会启用消费者资源池访问。"

msgid ""
"The `recompute` policy above applies to non-hybrid models. For hybrid models,\n"
"use `fail` as shown in the [hybrid attention guide](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md#usage).\n"
"Select model, parallelism, token-budget, and execution-mode options according\n"
"to the corresponding model deployment guide."
msgstr ""
"上述 `recompute` "
"策略适用于非混合模型。对于混合模型，请按照[混合注意力指南](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md#usage)中的说明使用 "
"`fail`。请根据相应的模型部署指南选择模型、并行度、token 预算和执行模式选项。"

msgid "### Use Cached Prefixes"
msgstr "### 使用缓存前缀"

msgid "Send inference requests through the normal OpenAI-compatible API:"
msgstr "通过常规的 OpenAI 兼容 API 发送推理请求："

msgid ""
"The response contains generated text in `choices`. To reuse the pool, submit\n"
"requests with the same tokenized prefix long enough to cover complete cache\n"
"blocks. The first request populates the Store; later requests can load committed\n"
"blocks and compute the remaining tokens. A final partial block is recomputed."
msgstr ""
"响应在 `choices` 中包含生成的文本。要复用资源池，请提交具有相同 token 化前缀的请求，且前缀长度足以覆盖完整的缓存块。第一个请求会填充 "
"Store；后续请求可以加载已提交的块并计算剩余 token。最后一个不完整的块会被重新计算。"

msgid ""
"To check cross-instance reuse, send a long shared prefix to one instance, wait\n"
"for its request to finish, then send it to another instance connected to the same\n"
"pool. Check external prefix-cache hits in the serving metrics or logs. Requests\n"
"repeated on one instance may instead hit its local prefix cache."
msgstr ""
"要检查跨实例复用，请向一个实例发送较长的共享前缀，等待其请求完成，然后将其发送到连接到同一资源池的另一个实例。在服务指标或日志中检查外部前缀缓存命中情况。在同一实例上重复的请求可能会命中其本地前缀缓存。"

msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid "Set these options in `kv_transfer_config.kv_connector_extra_config`."
msgstr "在 `kv_transfer_config.kv_connector_extra_config` 中设置这些选项。"

msgid "| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 默认值 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `backend` | string | `\"mooncake\"` | Selects the Mooncake Store backend. "
"|"
msgstr "| `backend` | string | `\"mooncake\"` | 选择 Mooncake Store 后端。 |"

msgid ""
"| `use_layerwise` | bool | `false` | Set to `true` to enable layerwise save "
"and load. |"
msgstr "| `use_layerwise` | bool | `false` | 设置为 `true` 以启用逐层保存和加载。 |"

msgid ""
"| `load_async` | bool | `false` | Keep `false` for layerwise loading. "
"Future-layer prefetch is managed by the layerwise transfer pipeline. |"
msgstr "| `load_async` | bool | `false` | 逐层加载时保持为 `false`。后续层预取由逐层传输流水线管理。 |"

msgid ""
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` | int | `2` | Positive prefetch distance in "
"layers. Larger values submit loads earlier. |"
msgstr ""
"| `layerwise_prefetch_layers` | int | `2` | 以层为单位的正预取距离。值越大，加载提交得越早。 |"

msgid ""
"| `layerwise_max_transfer_blocks` | int | `0` | Maximum key/block rows per "
"range transfer batch. Also batches session operations and lookup work. `0` "
"adds no block limit. |"
msgstr ""
"| `layerwise_max_transfer_blocks` | int | `0` | 每个范围传输批次的最大 "
"key/块行数。同时用于批处理会话操作和查找工作。`0` 表示不添加块限制。 |"

msgid ""
"| `layerwise_max_transfer_bytes` | int | `0` | Maximum size in bytes of an "
"individual contiguous transfer segment. Larger segments are split. This is "
"not a limit on total bytes per API call; `0` adds no segment-size limit. |"
msgstr ""
"| `layerwise_max_transfer_bytes` | int | `0` | 单个连续传输段的最大字节数。较大的段会被拆分。这不是每次 "
"API 调用的总字节数限制；`0` 表示不添加段大小限制。 |"

msgid ""
"Transfer batch limits are optional and are omitted from the examples. For\n"
"roles, placement, tenancy, and other pool options, see\n"
"[Ascend Store configuration](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#kv-transfer-config-common-parameters)."
msgstr ""
"传输批次限制是可选的，示例中已省略。有关角色、放置、租户及其他资源池选项，请参阅 [Ascend Store "
"配置](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#kv-transfer-config-common-parameters)。"

msgid "## Tuning Suggestions"
msgstr "## 调优建议"

msgid ""
"- Start with the default prefetch distance of `2`. Increase it if layers wait\n"
"  for remote loads; reduce it if early transfers contend with other communication.\n"
"- Use block and segment limits to control transfer batch size for long prompts.\n"
"  Smaller batches reduce per-call work but increase the number of calls.\n"
"- Evaluate time to first token and throughput with representative prompt lengths\n"
"  and prefix hit rates. Benefits depend on how much transfer the attention\n"
"  computation can hide and on contention with HCCL or expert-parallel traffic."
msgstr ""
"- 从默认预取距离 `2` 开始。如果各层等待远程加载，则增大该值；如果早期传输与其他通信争用，则减小该值。\n"
"- 使用块和段限制来控制长提示词下的传输批次大小。较小的批次可减少每次调用的工作量，但会增加调用次数。\n"
"- 使用具有代表性的提示词长度和前缀命中率来评估首 token 时间和吞吐量。收益取决于注意力计算能隐藏多少传输，以及与 HCCL 或专家并行流量的争用情况。"
